    'Introduced to music through classical piano in elementary school, she transitioned to pop piano in middle school and began teaching herself composition. After entering Sangmyung University to major in Korea-Japan Cultural Contents, she pursued a double major in New Media Composition.',
    'Her experience across these distinct disciplines culminates in a classical-based hybrid sound. Layering contemporary sensibilities over a solid structural foundation, she paints the illusions in her mind as vivid, real-world music.',
  ],
  realName: { label: 'Real name', name: '임수빈(iM SOOBIN)' },
  teachers: {
    label: 'Studied under',
    items: [
      { field: 'Composition', names: 'Seung Jae Chung, 김주환(ENDO KIM)' },
      { field: 'Piano', names: '배민서' },
